                                      NON-COLLAPSE LAW


        service is not authority          storage is not meaning          transport is not mutation

        proposal is not approval          cache is not canon              view is not organism

        KSP serves                         KOR governs                     human approval binds

        dStor carries fragments            KapGit carries accepted state    TXXM carries action

        KOM/KRC carries recomposition       KNT carries routes              PortalKOR carries perception


